//! AC description: For any two serde_json::Value::Object values whose key/value pairs are identical multisets, canonical_json_bytes returns byte-identical output. Holds recursively on nested objects. Arrays preserve their original order (positional semantics; reordering changes the canonical bytes).
//! Test predicate: tests/acceptance_ac2_permutation_stable.rs
